  "question": {
    "text": "If $\\sin ^{-1}\\left(\\frac{x}{5}\\right)+\\operatorname{cosec}^{-1}\\left(\\frac{5}{4}\\right)=\\frac{\\pi}{2}$ then a value of $x$ is"
